      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEL BOCAVISTA BAY (8) finished eighth last start over 2130m at this track, beaten 14 metres, after filling a minor placing at the previous appearance over 2185m at Pinjarra. Must overcome a very wide draw. This doesn't look as hard so he is sure to prove tough to beat. BEAT THE BANK (3) was out of the money two runs back here then displayed pleasing improvement last start to score by 1.4 metres over 2130m at the same circuit. Has the benefit of a good draw. Ideally placed and is sure to be there at the finish again. CONTROL THE ROOM (2) is better than his last-start ninth over 2185m at Pinjarra. Can bounce back from the favourable draw. RAKERO RAIDER NZ (11) is also in contention although the draw makes his job a bit tougher.",
